{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35207","headline":"公子行二首 一 · 聂夷中","name":"公子行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉代多豪族，恩深益骄逸。\n走马踏杀人，街吏不敢诘。\n红楼宴青春，数里望云蔚。\n金缸焰胜画，不畏落晖疾。\n美人尽如月，南威莫能匹。\n芙蓉自天来，不向水中出。\n飞琼奏云和，碧箫吹凤质。\n唯恨鲁阳死，无人驻白日。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}